<p>In general, the more I ponder this thing, the more I like it. A few calculatedly-brief addenda regarding containment breaches could go a long way towards giving this a little more of a chilling edge, but even without it I rather like the idea. The imagery is delightful, and as Flames said, the idea of this thing getting loose is full of win.</p>

